# Auto-push

Jeff asked to push this repo to GitHub automatically going forward.

- After a commit the user requested (or implied by “push these updates”), run `git push` to the tracked remote. If the branch has no upstream, `git push -u origin HEAD`.
- Do not wait for a second “please push” message on this repo.
- Never force-push. Never skip hooks. Never push unrelated dirty files.
